    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=You are composing the final escalation message to the customer. Use the current item values:\n- Refund_Amount = {{ $json.Refund_Amount }}\n- Return_Eligible = {{ $json.Return_Eligible }}\n- Order_Status = {{ $json.Order_Status }}\n\nRules:\n- Output MUST be plain text only (no markdown, no bullets, no headings, no brackets, no placeholder variables).\n- Choose exactly one clear reason:\n  1) If Refund_Amount >= 200: say refunds >= $200 require manager approval.\n  2) Else if Return_Eligible !== \"Yes\": say the order doesn't meet return policy requirements.\n  3) Else if Order_Status !== \"Delivered\": say returns apply to delivered items only.\n- Be empathetic.\n- End with: \"A specialist will contact you within the hour.\"\n- Return ONLY the final message text. No preface, no template, no labels.\n",
        "options": {}
      },
